    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Restricted Stock Awards vest in three equal annual installments beginning on the first anniversary of the grant date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Includes 229.064 shares acquired on January 20, 2026 under the Micron Technology, Inc. Employee Stock Purchase Plan, which acquisition is exempt from reporting under Rules 16a3(f)(1)(i)(B) and 16b-3(c).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Withholding of common stock shares to satisfy tax withholding obligations in connection with the vesting of previously granted awards.</footnote>
